      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Holly%2C_Colorado"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The historic Atchison, Topeka, and Santa Fe Depot serves as Holly’s town hall, linking the town to the National Old Trails Road.",
